From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MinaKaramApex <Mina.Karam@apexmedical.ai>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:56:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat(openobserve): upload JS bundles with content-type
 text/javascript

Carries over openobserve/browser-sdk#29 (commit 608d1914f), made directly on
the openobserve branch and so not in the patch series: scripts/deploy passes
--content-type text/javascript to aws s3 cp so the CDN serves a JS MIME type.
deploy.spec updated accordingly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
